9
00:00:46,744 --> 00:00:50,707
And now,
X THE LEAGUE is creating an opportunity...

10
00:00:50,707 --> 00:00:53,298
As K-content drives K-commerce,

11
00:00:53,298 --> 00:00:56,881
and that value flows back into the economy,

12
00:00:56,881 --> 00:00:59,018
now is the critical time to build that cycle.

13
00:00:59,018 --> 00:01:01,592
Through global influencers and their fandoms,

14
00:01:01,592 --> 00:01:06,674
