17
00:01:14,828 --> 00:01:17,638
It's never been a better time
for Korean products in the US...

18
00:01:17,638 --> 00:01:19,918
and they're only getting more popular.

19
00:01:19,918 --> 00:01:21,955
One thing about Singapore is that

20
00:01:21,955 --> 00:01:26,028
it's a great launch pad
for Korean businesses entering Southeast Asia.

21
00:01:26,028 --> 00:01:28,446
Like Thailand, Indonesia, Vietnam...

22
00:01:28,446 --> 00:01:31,745
A lot of brands
do their testing in Singapore as well.

23
00:01:31,745 --> 00:01:35,409
Showing products in my everyday life
helps build trust,

24
00:01:35,409 --> 00:01:39,439
which drives more interest and sales.

25
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:46,048
Our companies need to stand by
the promises they make about their products.

26
00:01:46,048 --> 00:01:48,865
I believe these valuable discussions
will give our companies

27
00:01:48,865 --> 00:01:51,855
