101
00:06:05,931 --> 00:06:09,731
We have actress Yoo In Young with us.

102
00:06:09,731 --> 00:06:11,177
Hello.

103
00:06:11,177 --> 00:06:14,341
[Actress Jung So Min]

104
00:06:14,341 --> 00:06:16,778
Hello, I'm model Park Ji Eun.

105
00:06:16,778 --> 00:06:19,598
[Countless collabs with famous sellers]
You're so famous.

106
00:06:19,598 --> 00:06:23,657
[The studio for the Round 4 collab live]
So I invited her here for today's live.

107
00:06:25,191 --> 00:06:28,928
[Ki Eunse joins Sangeununnie for a collab live]

108
00:06:28,928 --> 00:06:30,444
Hello!

109
00:06:31,131 --> 00:06:33,695
Wow, this is incredible.

110
00:06:33,695 --> 00:06:36,355
[She loves the place]
This is such a great space for today's live.

111
00:06:36,355 --> 00:06:39,863
This round is about doing collab lives.

112
00:06:39,863 --> 00:06:44,896
She asked if I'd do one with her,
and of course, I said yes.

113
00:06:44,896 --> 00:06:49,134
Do you do giveaways during your live streams?

114
00:06:49,134 --> 00:06:51,945
[Freebie 1]
Yes. There's this T-shirt...

115
00:06:51,945 --> 00:06:54,195
[Freebie 2]
and this toothbrush...

116
00:06:54,195 --> 00:06:55,765
All of these come with it.

117
00:06:55,765 --> 00:06:58,102
[Plenty of giveaway items]
A toothbrush.

118
00:06:58,102 --> 00:07:00,570
What's the biggest discount today?

119
00:07:00,570 --> 00:07:03,840
With the Sangeununnie coupon,
it's up to 54% off.

120
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:06,683
- That's huge. Almost half price.
- Yes.

121
00:07:06,683 --> 00:07:10,207
Plus free same-day delivery and freebies.

122
00:07:10,207 --> 00:07:11,556
[How's that?]

123
00:07:11,556 --> 00:07:14,035
[Good job]

124
00:07:14,035 --> 00:07:16,233
[The collab live officially begins]
- Hello! - Welcome!

125
00:07:16,233 --> 00:07:17,039
Welcome!

126
00:07:17,039 --> 00:07:20,522
Hi! I was invited to be
Sangeununnie's model today.

127
00:07:20,522 --> 00:07:21,667
[Amazing!]
[You both look gorgeous!]

128
00:07:21,667 --> 00:07:23,959
[The chat erupts when Ki Eunse appears]

129
00:07:23,959 --> 00:07:27,982
We'll show you the tints first today.

130
00:07:27,982 --> 00:07:29,424
Which one should we show first?

131
00:07:29,424 --> 00:07:31,208
[Ready to go]
The matte one.

132
00:07:31,208 --> 00:07:32,892
[Reading the comments]
Start with the matte one?

133
00:07:32,892 --> 00:07:35,765
I only put a little
on the outer part of my lower lip.

134
00:07:35,765 --> 00:07:37,415
[Ki Eunse quickly reads and engages viewers]

135
00:07:37,415 --> 00:07:39,688
You can apply a little more here.

136
00:07:39,688 --> 00:07:40,713
Pretty.

137
00:07:40,713 --> 00:07:42,745
[Looking radiant as ever]
The combo looks great.

138
00:07:42,745 --> 00:07:44,248
It's so pretty.

139
00:07:44,248 --> 00:07:46,475
[All eyes on Ki Eunse]
Pure beauty.

140
00:07:46,475 --> 00:07:49,852
Eunse is a total pro at live streaming.

141
00:07:49,852 --> 00:07:52,467
She played off me so well.

142
00:07:52,467 --> 00:07:56,266
When I was swatching the colors,
she'd read the comments.

143
00:07:56,266 --> 00:07:59,570
"I've been doing lifting exercises.
My cheekbones are higher now." Really?

144
00:07:59,570 --> 00:08:02,810
Our age gap is a secret, everyone.

145
00:08:02,810 --> 00:08:04,195
It's not that big!

146
00:08:04,195 --> 00:08:06,727
When I read the comments,
she'd swatch the colors...

147
00:08:06,727 --> 00:08:08,791
Someone says you
make them want to hit the beach.

148
00:08:08,791 --> 00:08:10,881
- Right? Me too.
- Me too.

149
00:08:10,881 --> 00:08:14,854
[Purchase confirmations flood the chat]
That plump shine along the lip line

150
00:08:14,854 --> 00:08:16,370
looks so good.

151
00:08:16,370 --> 00:08:20,559
We were both pros,
so the live went really smoothly.

152
00:08:20,559 --> 00:08:22,329
[But then...]

153
00:08:24,334 --> 00:08:28,141
[Something looks serious]

154
00:08:28,141 --> 00:08:31,818
Because Seol Hwa lost access to her account...

155
00:08:31,818 --> 00:08:34,834
I mean her social media account.

156
00:08:34,834 --> 00:08:39,145
We decided to promote her product together

157
00:08:39,145 --> 00:08:41,424
in a group live.

158
00:08:41,424 --> 00:08:43,018
[Team Korea hits a snag in the round]

159
00:08:43,946 --> 00:08:45,758
[A few days earlier, at Seol Hwa's home]

160
00:08:47,057 --> 00:08:48,356
[Sigh]

161
00:08:49,426 --> 00:08:53,486
[What happened to her?]

162
00:08:53,486 --> 00:08:59,765
The account I'd had for 14 years
was suddenly disabled overnight.

163
00:09:00,370 --> 00:09:03,334
[Searching her actual ID...]

164
00:09:03,334 --> 00:09:04,644
[An error has occurred]

165
00:09:04,644 --> 00:09:06,828
Actually, for the past six months...

166
00:09:06,828 --> 00:09:09,632
posts that were perfectly fine
started getting deleted

167
00:09:09,632 --> 00:09:12,935
for things like violence or rights violations.

168
00:09:12,935 --> 00:09:16,186
I appealed, but it was rejected.

169
00:09:16,186 --> 00:09:20,039
I've heard
this is happening to a lot of people.

170
00:09:21,232 --> 00:09:23,643
What do I do? I built it for 14 years.

171
00:09:23,643 --> 00:09:26,263
But that's not even the biggest problem.

172
00:09:26,263 --> 00:09:28,603
I can't even go live right now.

173
00:09:28,603 --> 00:09:30,793
I'm in the middle of an X THE LEAGUE group buy
through my account...

174
00:09:30,793 --> 00:09:31,975
Right.

175
00:09:31,975 --> 00:09:35,338
[Falling apart at the worst possible time]
I'm freaking out.

176
00:09:35,338 --> 00:09:36,372
<i>Hello?</i>

177
00:09:36,372 --> 00:09:38,672
[She tells Ki Eunse what happened]
Hi, it's Seol Hwa.

178
00:09:38,672 --> 00:09:40,109
<i>Hey.</i>

179
00:09:40,109 --> 00:09:41,859
Eunse, I...

180
00:09:41,859 --> 00:09:43,702
[At a loss]

181
00:09:43,702 --> 00:09:50,168
The social account I normally use
has been disabled.

182
00:09:50,168 --> 00:09:52,445
<i>Really? Why?</i>

183
00:09:52,445 --> 00:09:56,295
[Explaining what happened]
It was just disabled overnight.

184
00:09:56,295 --> 00:09:58,742
There hadn't been any problem at all.

185
00:09:58,742 --> 00:10:02,486
I'm in the middle of an X THE LEAGUE group buy,

186
00:10:02,486 --> 00:10:05,350
[Worried about the team's score]
we're filming, and I still have to go live.

187
00:10:05,350 --> 00:10:10,143
<i>You can still use
the other team members' accounts for the live.</i>

188
00:10:10,143 --> 00:10:12,969
[Seol Hwa feels she's burdening the team]
I feel awful. What do I do?

189
00:10:14,564 --> 00:10:16,615
For now,

190
00:10:16,615 --> 00:10:21,051
I don't want to burden everyone,
so I'll make a backup account

191
00:10:21,051 --> 00:10:25,449
and keep learning and working from there.

192
00:10:25,449 --> 00:10:28,579
<i>Then for this round's live,</i>

193
00:10:28,579 --> 00:10:32,215
<i>I'll talk to everyone
and schedule a group live.</i>

194
00:10:32,215 --> 00:10:34,605
[A joint live turns crisis into opportunity]
Thank you.

195
00:10:34,605 --> 00:10:38,001
My account is disabled right now,

196
00:10:38,001 --> 00:10:40,025
but I'll keep working from my backup account

197
00:10:40,025 --> 00:10:45,143
and do my best
to minimize any impact on my team.

198
00:10:45,143 --> 00:10:47,597
[A few days later]
Well...

199
00:10:48,464 --> 00:10:52,494
[Kkakk Unni and Seol Hwa]
I'm on a backup account, so it's not ideal.

200
00:10:52,494 --> 00:10:57,164
I posted something late yesterday,
so there hasn't been much response yet.

201
00:10:57,164 --> 00:11:01,024
- But you can keep improving with feedback...
- Hi.

202
00:11:01,024 --> 00:11:03,048
- Hello.
- Hi.

203
00:11:03,048 --> 00:11:06,284
[What's on today's agenda?]
You look beautiful today too.

204
00:11:06,284 --> 00:11:10,924
Since Seol Hwa can't go live on her account,
I planned a group live.

205
00:11:10,924 --> 00:11:15,156
And before today's stream,
I gave them some feedback.

206
00:11:15,156 --> 00:11:18,882
[Sharing feedback on the team's content]
So we met up to talk it through.

207
00:11:18,882 --> 00:11:22,703
- I gave you some feedback last time, right?
- Yes.

208
00:11:22,703 --> 00:11:24,341
How was it after that?

209
00:11:24,341 --> 00:11:27,371
- I took your feedback and posted...
- Did you change it up a bit?

210
00:11:27,371 --> 00:11:28,568
I've only posted one so far...

211
00:11:28,568 --> 00:11:30,728
[Content posted after Ki Eunse's advice]
Yes, like this...

212
00:11:30,728 --> 00:11:32,752
When I saw it, I thought,

213
00:11:32,752 --> 00:11:35,519
It looks prettier. Your feed looks nice.

214
00:11:35,519 --> 00:11:38,696
- It looks great.
- Your outfit stands out much more now.

215
00:11:38,696 --> 00:11:41,623
- Exactly.
- When I first looked at your feed,

216
00:11:41,623 --> 00:11:46,186
I felt like it didn't
show enough of who you are.

217
00:11:46,186 --> 00:11:50,763
You're beautiful, you're in great shape,
and you have so much going for you.

218
00:11:50,763 --> 00:11:54,133
[Solution: highlight her strengths]
But your feed doesn't show enough of that.

219
00:11:54,133 --> 00:11:58,084
You're athletic and even have amazing abs.

220
00:11:58,084 --> 00:12:01,474
Showing more of that would work really well.

221
00:12:01,474 --> 00:12:02,559
Yes.

222
00:12:02,559 --> 00:12:04,584
You have so many strengths,

223
00:12:04,584 --> 00:12:08,259
so showing more of your charm
would make your feed much better.

224
00:12:08,259 --> 00:12:10,727
[More meaningful advice, worked out together]
I'll try it. Thank you.

225
00:12:10,727 --> 00:12:13,800
And as for Kkakk Unni...

226
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,437
We're doing a live today, right?

227
00:12:15,437 --> 00:12:18,228
You seem a little unsure about going live.

228
00:12:18,228 --> 00:12:19,431
- I am.
- Yeah.

229
00:12:19,431 --> 00:12:21,541
[A quick pre-live lesson]
So I wanted us to go over it first.

230
00:12:21,541 --> 00:12:24,744
I've made lots of
short-form videos and content,

231
00:12:24,744 --> 00:12:28,801
but I honestly haven't done many lives,
so I'm really nervous.

232
00:12:28,801 --> 00:12:30,759
My mind just goes blank.

233
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:32,264
[They both relate]
- Exactly. - Seriously.

234
00:12:32,264 --> 00:12:35,151
Eunse is great at live streaming,
so just ask her lots of questions.

235
00:12:35,151 --> 00:12:38,492
- The queen of live streaming.
- I'm really relying on you.

236
00:12:38,492 --> 00:12:41,858
For me, interaction is the key to a live.

237
00:12:41,858 --> 00:12:47,628
Our live-commerce setup
doesn't support in-stream checkout,

238
00:12:47,628 --> 00:12:50,039
[Purchases require a separate link]
so on a live...

239
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,937
it's less about explaining the product

240
00:12:51,937 --> 00:12:55,926
and more about wanting to talk to the host.

241
00:12:55,926 --> 00:12:58,736
[Engaging with viewers is key]
I think that's what people enjoy.

