[Elle Onni takes the baton with a nonstop live]

483
00:24:06,173 --> 00:24:09,446
[Sonia goes just as hard on her live]

484
00:24:10,408 --> 00:24:14,838
[Jomama goes straight to the brand to sell]

485
00:24:14,838 --> 00:24:16,528
[Jomama]

486
00:24:16,528 --> 00:24:18,014
- I love it.
- Thank you.

487
00:24:18,761 --> 00:24:23,000
[Live with precise product details]

488
00:24:23,632 --> 00:24:26,834
[By communicating directly with the brand]

489
00:24:27,569 --> 00:24:30,689
[She deepens her product knowledge]

490
00:24:31,387 --> 00:24:35,623
[Jomama's signature BGM]

491
00:24:36,456 --> 00:24:41,278
[Winning viewers with expert live selling]

492
00:24:44,319 --> 00:24:47,462
[Their efforts to boost total sales]

493
00:24:47,462 --> 00:24:49,737
[JianHao Tan & Debbie Soon]
[A collab live for mission points]

494
00:24:49,737 --> 00:24:51,221
We definitely have a good chance.

495
00:24:51,221 --> 00:24:53,894
We hope to stay in the X1 tier,

496
00:24:53,894 --> 00:24:59,031
and we'll do our best
to hold our position or move up.

497
00:24:59,031 --> 00:25:02,625
I understand Team Indonesia also has a couple.

498
00:25:02,625 --> 00:25:07,625
I think, while Indonesia is a massive market,

499
00:25:07,625 --> 00:25:09,462
both couples have their own strengths.

500
00:25:09,462 --> 00:25:12,016
I have a lot of faith in our couple.

501
00:25:12,016 --> 00:25:16,069
[A couple with perfect chemistry]
I trust JianHao Tan and Debbie Soon.

502
00:25:16,069 --> 00:25:20,182
We will try our very best for this round,

503
00:25:20,182 --> 00:25:26,058
and I hope that with our effort,
we can maintain our X1 tier position.

504
00:25:26,058 --> 00:25:29,858
[Singapore's rival couple]
[Indonesia's Atta & Aurel Hermansyah]

505
00:25:30,612 --> 00:25:34,718
[860+ simultaneous buyers
whenever they go live]

506
00:25:36,018 --> 00:25:38,818
[About KRW 42 million
in sales in just one hour]

507
00:25:39,702 --> 00:25:44,732
[Sales powerhouses Atta & Aurel
go full throttle]

508
00:25:44,732 --> 00:25:47,795
[How much firepower
will they bring to Round 4?]

509
00:25:48,417 --> 00:25:50,151
[The strongest contender to win?]

510
00:25:50,151 --> 00:25:51,201
China.

511
00:25:51,201 --> 00:25:53,079
Still, I'd say China.

512
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:54,267
China.

513
00:25:54,267 --> 00:25:58,505
China is strong based on population alone.

514
00:25:58,505 --> 00:26:01,344
[Everyone picks Team China to win]
I've heard China is really strong at this...

515
00:26:01,344 --> 00:26:05,671
Honestly, this game is already won.

516
00:26:05,671 --> 00:26:08,331
We just have to finish it off!

517
00:26:08,331 --> 00:26:12,401
We could easily make around KRW 10 billion.

518
00:26:12,401 --> 00:26:14,488
[Team China was confident, but...]
The final results for Round 1.

519
00:26:14,488 --> 00:26:15,748
In second place...

520
00:26:15,748 --> 00:26:16,805
China.

521
00:26:16,805 --> 00:26:18,637
[Round 1: 2nd]

522
00:26:18,637 --> 00:26:20,755
In fourth place...

523
00:26:20,755 --> 00:26:22,255
China.

524
00:26:22,255 --> 00:26:24,995
[Round 2: 4th]

525
00:26:24,995 --> 00:26:26,905
How can we be ranked this low?

526
00:26:26,905 --> 00:26:28,575
[Team China is shocked by its low ranking]

527
00:26:28,575 --> 00:26:30,226
China, in third.

528
00:26:30,226 --> 00:26:34,004
[Round 3: 3rd]

529
00:26:34,004 --> 00:26:36,208
[Drops from 2nd in total sales to 3rd overall]

530
00:26:36,208 --> 00:26:39,218
That's why the mission score is so important.

531
00:26:39,218 --> 00:26:41,801
It'd be so frustrating
if we don't get those points.

532
00:26:41,801 --> 00:26:44,082
[Missing X1 again leaves Team China rattled]

533
00:26:44,082 --> 00:26:45,176
How could this happen?

534
00:26:45,176 --> 00:26:47,096
I'm honestly so mad...

535
00:26:47,096 --> 00:26:50,386
[Team China's slide feels unfair]
Maybe not mad, but honestly, it feels unfair.

536
00:26:50,386 --> 00:26:53,186
We can't take the mission lightly.

537
00:26:53,186 --> 00:26:58,372
[Team China aims to turn Round 4 around]
We need this round to reach first place or X1.

538
00:26:59,154 --> 00:27:04,316
[Round 4 Mission: Collab Live]
[But the team members live all over]

539
00:27:04,316 --> 00:27:06,473
The way I see it,

540
00:27:06,473 --> 00:27:09,372
China is at the biggest disadvantage right now.

541
00:27:09,372 --> 00:27:11,674
[Team China holds an emergency meeting]

542
00:27:11,674 --> 00:27:14,320
I've contacted Ma Lingdao and HU XIAOKA.

543
00:27:15,271 --> 00:27:17,090
[Their schedules
make it hard to gather everyone]

544
00:27:17,090 --> 00:27:18,414
[Worried]

545
00:27:18,414 --> 00:27:20,156
Then I'll just go.

546
00:27:20,156 --> 00:27:21,649
It's only two hours away anyway...

547
00:27:21,649 --> 00:27:26,045
[Xiaoshu Ouni chooses Korea without hesitation]

548
00:27:26,045 --> 00:27:30,613
This time, I'm really going to stay in Korea.

549
00:27:30,613 --> 00:27:35,155
Whoever goes live, I'll be ready to get there.

550
00:27:35,155 --> 00:27:38,102
We have to strategize like this, or...

551
00:27:38,102 --> 00:27:40,638
[No room left to fall]
we could end up in X2 or X3 again.

552
00:27:40,638 --> 00:27:44,907
[Clearing her schedule and going all in]
I was so worried, I just came to stay in Korea.

553
00:27:44,907 --> 00:27:46,586
Then fly over right away.

554
00:27:46,586 --> 00:27:48,260
[Xiaoshu Ouni's bold choice lifts the mood]

555
00:27:48,260 --> 00:27:49,364
That's what I thought too.

556
00:27:49,364 --> 00:27:54,052
You're preparing for pregnancy,
so thank you for doing this for our team.

557
00:27:54,052 --> 00:27:57,780
We'll win first place,
then I can focus on having a baby.

558
00:27:57,780 --> 00:27:59,688
[Xiaoshu's husband]
[Dead serious about the mission]

559
00:27:59,688 --> 00:28:02,744
[Xiaoshu arrives in Korea for Round 4]

560
00:28:03,790 --> 00:28:05,844
[The day of the Round 4 collab live]

561
00:28:06,937 --> 00:28:09,128
This is our first collab live,

562
00:28:09,128 --> 00:28:14,794
but with our teamwork,
I think we'll get strong sales.

563
00:28:14,794 --> 00:28:17,539
Our goal this time is clear.

564
00:28:17,539 --> 00:28:19,427
"China takes first place."

565
00:28:20,429 --> 00:28:22,925
I'm really confident about this collab live.

566
00:28:22,925 --> 00:28:25,668
[Team China goes all in for Round 4]

567
00:28:25,668 --> 00:28:32,697
We came in third in Round 3,
and honestly, it felt so unfair.

568
00:28:32,697 --> 00:28:35,515
If it weren't for 618,
we would've easily beaten our goal.

569
00:28:35,515 --> 00:28:40,291
[618 held Team China back in Round 3]

570
00:28:40,291 --> 00:28:42,048
618 is...

571
00:28:42,048 --> 00:28:48,108
like a huge retailer running a blowout sale.

572
00:28:48,108 --> 00:28:49,565
[618: China's mega sale]
A battle of the giants.

573
00:28:49,565 --> 00:28:51,973
It's the best of the best going head-to-head.

574
00:28:51,973 --> 00:28:55,118
[Record-breaking 618 Shopping Festival]
618 discounts are huge.

575
00:28:55,118 --> 00:28:57,600
[Shoppers flock to major promotions]
And there are promotions everywhere.

576
00:28:57,600 --> 00:29:01,691
It's extremely tough
for smaller sellers like us.

577
00:29:01,691 --> 00:29:04,646
With those blowout sales...
and our limited stock...

578
00:29:04,646 --> 00:29:07,639
we can't compete on price at that level.

579
00:29:07,639 --> 00:29:09,826
Everyone goes to the big retailers.

580
00:29:09,826 --> 00:29:15,075
[Round 3 crushed by the massive shopping event]
We get hit from every side. We can do little.

581
00:29:15,075 --> 00:29:16,445
It's such a shame.

582
00:29:16,445 --> 00:29:17,859
We missed it by so little.

583
00:29:17,859 --> 00:29:19,574
We were second in total sales...

584
00:29:19,574 --> 00:29:22,981
When are we finally going to make X1?

585
00:29:22,981 --> 00:29:26,116
[Team China has stayed in X2 since Round 1]

586
00:29:26,116 --> 00:29:31,967
In Round 4,
we can't lose because of the mission.

587
00:29:31,967 --> 00:29:34,803
[Nods]
It'd be so frustrating to lose on the mission.

588
00:29:34,803 --> 00:29:37,973
Now that June 18th has passed,
traffic should recover too.

589
00:29:37,973 --> 00:29:39,408
[Time to win back the X1 rank they lost]

590
00:29:39,408 --> 00:29:43,646
This mission is a joint livestream.

591
00:29:43,646 --> 00:29:45,481
So this time I prepared Me****.

592
00:29:45,481 --> 00:29:48,384
Because this product gets
pretty good visibility on the platform.

593
00:29:48,384 --> 00:29:50,653
I've been thinking...

594
00:29:50,653 --> 00:29:54,089
since I'm Korean, there are parts
where my delivery doesn't land well.

595
00:29:54,089 --> 00:29:57,226
So I'd like you two to act as my co-hosts.

596
00:29:57,226 --> 00:29:58,460
[Today's daily assistants:
Damin and Cui Shishi]

597
00:29:58,460 --> 00:30:03,132
The thing is, people are more drawn
in when you talk about the deals, right?

598
00:30:03,132 --> 00:30:05,100
But people just don't react to what I say.

599
00:30:05,100 --> 00:30:07,970
[Covering the weakness
through a joint livestream]

600
00:30:07,970 --> 00:30:10,072
Damin, your fans are
in their 30s and 40s too, right?

601
00:30:10,072 --> 00:30:12,041
Mine are a bit on the older side too.

602
00:30:12,041 --> 00:30:14,143
[Xiaoshu Ouni, who mainly sells beauty
products, has a fan base in their 30s-40s]

603
00:30:14,143 --> 00:30:16,111
[Damin's fan base is in their 30s-40s]

604
00:30:16,111 --> 00:30:18,947
[Cui Shishi's fan base is in their 50s-60s]

605
00:30:18,947 --> 00:30:20,716
Then during our broadcast,

606
00:30:20,716 --> 00:30:23,385
we can each prepare gifts
for one another's fans.

607
00:30:23,385 --> 00:30:26,322
[A strategy targeting
a wide range of fan bases]

608
00:30:26,322 --> 00:30:29,525
We're doing the joint livestream
on Xiaoshu Ouni's account,

609
00:30:29,525 --> 00:30:32,861
but each member tells their own fans,

610
00:30:32,861 --> 00:30:37,433
"Come shop at Xiaoshu Ouni's livestream,"

611
00:30:37,433 --> 00:30:40,569
and posts it on their own social media.

612
00:30:40,569 --> 00:30:42,438
[1.05 million followers, 927,000 followers,
400,000 followers]

613
00:30:42,438 --> 00:30:44,306
[With a combined reach
of about 2.4 million followers]

614
00:30:44,306 --> 00:30:47,976
[Team China,
all promoting the joint livestream]

615
00:30:47,976 --> 00:30:52,281
Anyway, for the mission,
we'll hit the highest number we can.

616
00:30:52,281 --> 00:30:56,385
This mission is worth 40 percent of the score.

617
00:30:56,385 --> 00:31:00,989
So our strategy is to take
first place no matter what.

618
00:31:00,989 --> 00:31:05,394
That way our odds go up later on.

619
00:31:05,394 --> 00:31:08,364
I really want to start off strong
and pull in the sales.

620
00:31:08,364 --> 00:31:11,391
We have to take first place this round.

621
00:31:11,391 --> 00:31:13,571
[The joint livestream begins in earnest]

622
00:31:13,571 --> 00:31:16,739
Today I prepared Me****.

623
00:31:16,739 --> 00:31:19,775
We've come to the Me**** headquarters.

624
00:31:19,775 --> 00:31:23,512
I invited some friends
to join today's livestream.

625
00:31:23,512 --> 00:31:26,415
[Bet you didn't expect this lineup?]

626
00:31:26,415 --> 00:31:28,450
You leave the mask on for about 30 minutes.

627
00:31:28,450 --> 00:31:29,985
[Calmly starting the product explanation]

628
00:31:29,985 --> 00:31:32,888
The bubbles fizz on your face
and open up your pores.

629
00:31:32,888 --> 00:31:35,758
[Cui Shishi filling in with support lines]

630
00:31:35,758 --> 00:31:39,495
You'll have a really hard time finding
a combination like this. Today I'm...

631
00:31:39,495 --> 00:31:43,198
Everyone's asking how to combine
these when they use them.

632
00:31:43,198 --> 00:31:44,767
[Team China getting a little shaky]

633
00:31:44,767 --> 00:31:47,202
[And owner Guo Qing checking her phone]

634
00:31:47,202 --> 00:31:50,105
The local price in Korea is *** won.

635
00:31:50,105 --> 00:31:52,174
If you came to buy it in person,
it'd run you close to *** won.

636
00:31:52,174 --> 00:31:53,342
That's right.

637
00:31:53,342 --> 00:31:56,612
It's normally *** won,
but today it's less than half price.

638
00:31:56,612 --> 00:31:59,515
[Working hard]

639
00:31:59,515 --> 00:32:04,623
[Damin's talking with no end in sight]

640
00:32:05,654 --> 00:32:08,457
[But we need to move on to the next part...]

641
00:32:08,457 --> 00:32:09,925
[The joint livestream getting a little chaotic]

642
00:32:09,925 --> 00:32:15,464
[Noisy and hectic]

643
00:32:15,464 --> 00:32:17,671
[Owner Guo Qing checking her phone again?]

644
00:32:17,671 --> 00:32:22,938
I took on the role of monitoring
what questions the fans are asking

645
00:32:22,938 --> 00:32:27,242
[Checking in on the livestream now and then]
and passing that along to them.

646
00:32:27,242 --> 00:32:30,479
At first everyone was jumping in with lines,

647
00:32:30,479 --> 00:32:32,981
but with several people
analyzing the product at once,

648
00:32:32,981 --> 00:32:35,017
it got way too noisy.

649
00:32:35,017 --> 00:32:38,420
Xiaoshu Ouni is the type
who delivers product info well

650
00:32:38,420 --> 00:32:41,023
and explains calmly,

651
00:32:41,023 --> 00:32:44,827
so a sudden burst of noise
could startle her fans.

652
00:32:44,827 --> 00:32:47,663
So we changed our strategy partway through.

653
00:32:47,663 --> 00:32:52,034
Only two people on screen,
with the third person rotating in.

654
00:32:52,034 --> 00:32:55,437
[Running the joint livestream with two people]

655
00:32:55,437 --> 00:32:57,039
Everyone, I'm the co-host today.

656
00:32:57,039 --> 00:32:59,508
[Bows]
Thanks, and let's do this.

657
00:32:59,508 --> 00:33:01,310
[The livestream mood, more settled than before]

658
00:33:01,310 --> 00:33:04,313
Me*** is a professional skincare brand.

659
00:33:04,313 --> 00:33:06,181
They have their own R&D team

660
00:33:06,181 --> 00:33:08,951
[Delivering the product info calmly]
and their own factory too.

661
00:33:08,951 --> 00:33:10,385
[Team China gaining momentum as two rotate in]

662
00:33:10,385 --> 00:33:12,020
Nice to meet you all.

663
00:33:13,388 --> 00:33:14,623
[About 60 million won]

664
00:33:14,623 --> 00:33:16,925
[Sales climbing nonstop]

665
00:33:16,925 --> 00:33:22,865
Four hours is draining and tough
even on your own account,

666
00:33:22,865 --> 00:33:25,734
but they worked as hard
as if it were their own.

667
00:33:25,734 --> 00:33:28,303
Without them, these sales
wouldn't have been possible today.

668
00:33:28,303 --> 00:33:32,474
Because sales grew by 20 to 30 percent.

669
00:33:32,474 --> 00:33:36,378
This time I'm staying in Korea for a month

670
00:33:36,378 --> 00:33:39,548
and doing lots of joint livestreams
with my teammates,

671
00:33:39,548 --> 00:33:43,551
so I can really rack up the mission score.

672
00:33:46,922 --> 00:33:51,793
[A full sprint toward a Round 4 comeback]

673
00:33:51,793 --> 00:33:55,397
[Can Team China win back the X1 rank?]

674
00:33:55,397 --> 00:33:58,013
[Vietnam]

675
00:34:00,802 --> 00:34:03,271
[Hanoi, Vietnam]

676
00:34:04,273 --> 00:34:07,576
[Team Vietnam, gathered together for Round 4]

677
00:34:07,576 --> 00:34:14,283
We dropped from 3rd down to 6th,
into the bottom tier.

678
00:34:14,283 --> 00:34:17,419
[Team Vietnam fell from 3rd in Round 2
to 6th in Round 3]

679
00:34:17,419 --> 00:34:19,955
[Frustrated]

680
00:34:19,955 --> 00:34:24,860
For Round 4, I think we have to go
beyond simply selling products.

681
00:34:24,860 --> 00:34:28,263
Teamwork and unity matter now.

682
00:34:28,263 --> 00:34:31,300
[With it being a joint livestream, teamwork
became crucial for the Round 4 mission]

683
00:34:31,300 --> 00:34:37,339
I think Luong Van Tuan has a strong point here.

684
00:34:37,339 --> 00:34:40,013
[What's Luong Van Tuan's strength?]

685
00:34:40,742 --> 00:34:44,279
[On-site, interactive livestreaming is a given]

686
00:34:44,279 --> 00:34:47,286
[His livestream account alone has
1.7 million followers]

687
00:34:48,383 --> 00:34:51,888
[A sales style that captures
both online and offline audiences]

688
00:34:52,754 --> 00:34:53,956
[Driving demand
through close customer interaction]

689
00:34:53,956 --> 00:34:56,124
[Buyer 1]

690
00:34:56,124 --> 00:34:57,124
[Buyer 2]

691
00:34:58,126 --> 00:35:01,963
We need to find what we have in common,

692
00:35:02,731 --> 00:35:06,335
and I think people
with the same product category

693
00:35:06,335 --> 00:35:09,404
should livestream together.

694
00:35:09,404 --> 00:35:12,074
For beauty, I think

695
00:35:12,074 --> 00:35:15,877
[Beauty & household goods]
the three of you should do it together.

696
00:35:15,877 --> 00:35:19,214
[The trio handling beauty care
and household goods]

697
00:35:19,214 --> 00:35:21,149
[Beauty care, Kim Oanh]

698
00:35:21,149 --> 00:35:25,453
Hi, I'm Kim Oanh.

699
00:35:26,388 --> 00:35:31,829
I started as a seller
only about two or three months ago.

700
00:35:31,829 --> 00:35:35,263
[Kim Oanh, a rising seller on the way up]

701
00:35:35,263 --> 00:35:39,134
[CEO of a modern Vietnamese fashion brand]

702
00:35:39,134 --> 00:35:43,138
[Around 1.49 million combined followers
on her beauty and brand accounts]

703
00:35:43,138 --> 00:35:46,141
Whenever they need help, I'll be right there,

704
00:35:46,141 --> 00:35:50,646
streaming and selling my hardest
to support them.

705
00:35:50,646 --> 00:35:53,882
[And Vietnam's other trump card]

706
00:35:53,882 --> 00:35:56,137
[Beauty care, Thuy Dung]

707
00:35:56,137 --> 00:36:00,922
Hi, I'm Thuy Dung from Team Vietnam.

708
00:36:00,922 --> 00:36:02,871
I think I first started around 2022.

709
00:36:02,871 --> 00:36:06,228
At first I started
because I wanted to earn more...

710
00:36:06,228 --> 00:36:09,137
[And the social media
she started for her family]

711
00:36:09,137 --> 00:36:11,378
but as I went along, I wanted to share products

712
00:36:11,378 --> 00:36:13,301
I'd tried and loved with my viewers.

713
00:36:13,301 --> 00:36:15,368
[Started by chance, driven by a real wish
to share good products]

714
00:36:15,368 --> 00:36:21,009
Before I became a seller,
I worked at a Sam*** factory.

715
00:36:21,009 --> 00:36:26,715
While I worked, I kept posting videos
on social media whenever I had time.

716
00:36:26,715 --> 00:36:32,838
[Fun and consistency
that sparked real interest]

717
00:36:32,838 --> 00:36:36,636
That opened the door for me
to start selling online.

718
00:36:36,636 --> 00:36:37,659
Okay.

719
00:36:37,659 --> 00:36:38,994
[The three of them handle
a similar product lineup together]

720
00:36:38,994 --> 00:36:40,529
So shall we go live?

721
00:36:40,529 --> 00:36:43,131
Let's do it. We can push our sales up.

722
00:36:43,131 --> 00:36:45,003
[Team Vietnam's first joint livestream begins]

723
00:36:45,003 --> 00:36:50,272
Today is a really special broadcast.

724
00:36:50,272 --> 00:36:54,810
We've got influencers
and pro sellers here together.

725
00:36:54,810 --> 00:37:00,117
The first product is, of course, An Cung***.

726
00:37:00,117 --> 00:37:01,838
[Kicking off the first product with energy]

727
00:37:01,838 --> 00:37:06,888
These boneless spicy chicken feet
are a huge favorite.

728
00:37:06,888 --> 00:37:09,964
[The team tastes it and shows it off up close]

729
00:37:11,026 --> 00:37:13,729
[Reactions explode
as the tasting whets everyone's appetite]

730
00:37:13,729 --> 00:37:17,632
The most important thing when you start
a livestream is energy.

731
00:37:17,632 --> 00:37:21,904
[Where are my rice cakes?]
[Where are the rice cakes?]

732
00:37:21,904 --> 00:37:25,011
[Moving to the next product
at the viewers' request]

733
00:37:25,707 --> 00:37:28,285
[Covers his mouth]
[Hoang Anh, the rising force of livestreaming]

734
00:37:29,077 --> 00:37:31,730
[Glares]

735
00:37:33,915 --> 00:37:35,863
[Covering his mouth to take back the floor]

736
00:37:37,052 --> 00:37:41,523
[A playful moment keeps the mood light and fun]

737
00:37:41,523 --> 00:37:43,204
Both of us have this style

738
00:37:43,204 --> 00:37:46,261
of introducing products
and chatting with viewers as we go...

739
00:37:46,261 --> 00:37:50,738
[Similar styles let them
lead the stream at ease]

740
00:37:51,967 --> 00:37:57,902
[Before they know it, viewers pass 1,400]

741
00:37:59,040 --> 00:38:05,413
[The joint stream where each pulls out
their signature product]

742
00:38:05,413 --> 00:38:08,784
From round 4 on, we're planning a big increase
in joint streams with our teammates.

743
00:38:08,784 --> 00:38:13,771
We'll keep going nonstop
and hit record-breaking sales.

744
00:38:13,771 --> 00:38:15,090
- Hello.
- Hello.

745
00:38:15,090 --> 00:38:19,839
[Hoang Anh and Thuy Dung dive straight
into their joint stream]

746
00:38:20,662 --> 00:38:23,165
The round-4 mission is a joint livestream,

747
00:38:23,165 --> 00:38:26,701
so today I asked Hoang Anh to stream with me.

748
00:38:26,701 --> 00:38:30,071
Hoang Anh and I are both
the youngest on the team...

749
00:38:30,071 --> 00:38:32,941
[Thuy Dung and Hoang Anh,
who also live near each other]

750
00:38:32,941 --> 00:38:35,577
I'm Hoang Anh from the An Cung*** brand.

751
00:38:35,577 --> 00:38:39,204
And joining me right now is Thuy Dung.

752
00:38:39,204 --> 00:38:40,571
Hi, nice to see you.

753
00:38:40,571 --> 00:38:43,618
[Five hundred viewers
the moment the stream starts]

754
00:38:43,618 --> 00:38:46,370
Come check it out, everyone.

755
00:38:46,370 --> 00:38:49,037
Let me show you this sunscreen spray.

756
00:38:49,037 --> 00:38:52,427
This sunscreen spray works
for both men and women, right?

757
00:38:52,427 --> 00:38:55,263
[Never forgetting to cover the product details]

758
00:38:55,263 --> 00:38:59,337
[Hoang Anh keeps an eye
on the comments even as they talk]

759
00:38:59,337 --> 00:39:02,170
Thuy Dung, your husband is quite the looker.

760
00:39:03,003 --> 00:39:07,804
Thuy Dung and I are just old friends.

761
00:39:07,804 --> 00:39:11,037
[Shy]
I think she's a really great friend.

762
00:39:12,314 --> 00:39:15,737
[Wrapping up the joint stream for round 4]

763
00:39:15,737 --> 00:39:17,485
Bye.

764
00:39:17,485 --> 00:39:22,724
[The joint streams don't stop from here on out]

765
00:39:22,724 --> 00:39:25,359
[Team Vietnam's all-out push
to reclaim their rank]

766
00:39:25,994 --> 00:39:30,413
[It's not over till it's over]

767
00:39:33,735 --> 00:39:38,187
[So where does Team Vietnam's
relentless sprint end?]

768
00:39:39,610 --> 00:39:41,471
[Mapo-gu, Seoul]
- Let's talk while we eat. - Okay.

769
00:39:41,471 --> 00:39:43,144
Dig in.

770
00:39:43,144 --> 00:39:45,213
Round 4's started,

771
00:39:45,213 --> 00:39:48,137
so I gathered everyone today
for a team pep rally.

772
00:39:48,137 --> 00:39:50,685
To cheer us on...

773
00:39:50,685 --> 00:39:52,270
[A special guest visits Team Korea]

774
00:39:52,270 --> 00:39:53,455
Thanks for your hard work.

775
00:39:53,455 --> 00:39:57,292
Watching you compete so hard

776
00:39:57,292 --> 00:40:00,471
for the national team these past three rounds,

777
00:40:00,471 --> 00:40:03,411
I wanted to cheer you on
and treat you to a good meal.

778
00:40:03,411 --> 00:40:08,137
Hope this gives you strength
for Rounds 4 and 5.

779
00:40:08,137 --> 00:40:11,037
- You came to treat us, right?
- Of course.

780
00:40:11,037 --> 00:40:12,040
Nice.

781
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:13,208
This place...

782
00:40:13,208 --> 00:40:14,509
This is my regular spot.

783
00:40:14,509 --> 00:40:17,612
[A spread that's reassuring just to look at]
Best restaurant in Sangam-dong.

784
00:40:17,612 --> 00:40:19,447
- Let's talk while we eat.
- Okay.

785
00:40:19,447 --> 00:40:21,249
Dig in.

786
00:40:23,137 --> 00:40:26,741
[A moment to recharge]

787
00:40:29,337 --> 00:40:33,061
Everyone else is out there working hard
on their livestreams,

788
00:40:33,061 --> 00:40:35,737
and I feel a little bad we snuck off to eat.

789
00:40:35,737 --> 00:40:37,399
I can't bring myself to eat.

790
00:40:37,399 --> 00:40:38,433
They'll come by later,

791
00:40:38,433 --> 00:40:39,868
[Ki Eunse & Kkang Stylist live collab]
so let's start without them.

792
00:40:39,868 --> 00:40:42,137
[Collab livestream for the Round 4 mission]
Someone asked what size the shirt

793
00:40:42,137 --> 00:40:43,438
I'm wearing is.

794
00:40:43,438 --> 00:40:46,574
Now they're asking if it's a cool,
breathable fabric.

795
00:40:46,574 --> 00:40:51,512
Someone says, "Please explain
why Kkang called Ki Eunse 'older sis.'"

796
00:40:53,784 --> 00:40:56,037
[Ki Eunse & Kkang Stylist collab livestream]
I need to start taking care of my skin.

797
00:40:56,037 --> 00:40:58,003
Oppa.

798
00:40:58,003 --> 00:40:59,301
Hello.

799
00:40:59,301 --> 00:41:03,070
[Joining the meal after the livestream]
Hello.

800
00:41:03,070 --> 00:41:06,161
How was it? Was it fun? Did it go well?

801
00:41:06,161 --> 00:41:07,871
- Was it fun?
- It was fun.

802
00:41:07,871 --> 00:41:10,131
[Joint livestream wrapped up successfully]
- We had a lot of fun. - It was fun.

803
00:41:10,131 --> 00:41:14,137
We had a lot of viewers too.

804
00:41:14,137 --> 00:41:15,303
I heard the numbers were really high.

805
00:41:15,303 --> 00:41:18,573
[Round 4 matters more than ever]
Round four is really important.

806
00:41:18,573 --> 00:41:20,909
We already kicked things off today.

807
00:41:20,909 --> 00:41:22,604
You guys did one together like this.

808
00:41:22,604 --> 00:41:24,612
- And then?
- I did one with him too.

809
00:41:24,612 --> 00:41:25,838
[Nonstop joint livestreams]
And one with her too.

810
00:41:25,838 --> 00:41:28,483
We really have to do well this time.

811
00:41:28,483 --> 00:41:33,190
My evenings this week are livestream,
livestream, livestream.

812
00:41:33,190 --> 00:41:34,970
Here, there, everywhere.

813
00:41:34,970 --> 00:41:36,691
[Too busy to even keep track]
I have livestreams all week long.

814
00:41:37,561 --> 00:41:40,061
Our goal is X1, take back second place.

815
00:41:40,061 --> 00:41:42,397
That's why I've been waiting for this round.

816
00:41:42,397 --> 00:41:45,135
It's the round where we can show our teamwork.

817
00:41:45,135 --> 00:41:46,670
We can all...

818
00:41:46,670 --> 00:41:50,970
[Joint livestreams come easy to Team Korea]
work together and join each other's streams.

819
00:41:50,970 --> 00:41:54,075
Maybe we can go for X1.

820
00:41:54,075 --> 00:41:56,778
- Really?
- This time...

821
00:41:57,679 --> 00:42:00,804
[Final push for total sales]

822
00:42:00,804 --> 00:42:05,887
This brand did win a Presidential Award,

823
00:42:05,887 --> 00:42:08,289
but to me...

824
00:42:08,289 --> 00:42:09,471
[Kkang Stylist's ace up his sleeve?]

825
00:42:09,471 --> 00:42:11,326
there's just nothing else like it...

826
00:42:11,326 --> 00:42:15,330
We're nearing the end of round 4,

827
00:42:15,330 --> 00:42:17,565
so I'm making my big move.

828
00:42:17,565 --> 00:42:19,968
I'm going to do everything I can
to put Team Korea in first place.

829
00:42:19,968 --> 00:42:22,637
[Final push for total sales]
They also make clothes for BLACKPINK,

830
00:42:22,637 --> 00:42:27,037
so I think it'd be better to mention that

831
00:42:27,037 --> 00:42:30,237
right in the opening.

832
00:42:30,237 --> 00:42:33,415
[Kkang Stylist carefully reviews the script]

833
00:42:33,415 --> 00:42:36,985
We have a series
on our YouTube channel called "Collabo*."

834
00:42:36,985 --> 00:42:39,037
The leather jacket brand
we're collaborating with today is...

835
00:42:39,037 --> 00:42:42,657
[A series introducing collab products]
The brand we're collaborating with today is...

836
00:42:42,657 --> 00:42:43,671
[110 videos, 246,140 views]

837
00:42:43,671 --> 00:42:46,294
[Kkang's flagship series for five years]
It's a series where we launch collab products.

838
00:42:46,294 --> 00:42:50,632
This time, we're collaborating with p*3*9.

839
00:42:50,632 --> 00:42:55,837
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to call him
one of Korea's most talked-about designers.

840
00:42:55,837 --> 00:43:01,176
He directs and makes concert outfits
for BLACKPINK members.

841
00:43:01,176 --> 00:43:04,871
He also won a Presidential Award
as a Korean designer.

842
00:43:04,871 --> 00:43:07,949
I could sing this brand's praises all day.

843
00:43:07,949 --> 00:43:09,217
[Collab with a star designer to boost sales]

844
00:43:09,217 --> 00:43:12,287
Today, we're launching
the short-sleeve T-shirt I'm wearing.

845
00:43:12,287 --> 00:43:16,391
When I first saw it,
I felt like it was missing something.

846
00:43:16,391 --> 00:43:18,259
Then I was scrolling through social media

847
00:43:18,259 --> 00:43:20,328
and saw a video
of the designer making it himself

848
00:43:20,328 --> 00:43:23,231
using paint and graphic techniques.

849
00:43:23,231 --> 00:43:25,033
The moment I saw it, I thought, "This is it.

850
00:43:25,033 --> 00:43:29,571
This is how I can get the look I want."

851
00:43:29,571 --> 00:43:34,609
[Handcrafted means a higher price point]

852
00:43:34,609 --> 00:43:37,445
I want to see the details
that go into the clothes up close,

853
00:43:37,445 --> 00:43:39,814
so I'm heading to the brand's workshop.

854
00:43:39,814 --> 00:43:43,618
There, I'm going to try
the wash treatment myself.

855
00:43:44,919 --> 00:43:47,437
It's nothing fancy. Welcome.

856
00:43:47,437 --> 00:43:50,261
This used to be our showroom.

857
00:43:50,261 --> 00:43:53,862
We turned the showroom into a workshop
for the collaboration.

858
00:43:53,862 --> 00:43:57,368
Our collab pieces are all here.

859
00:43:57,368 --> 00:43:58,500
You should give it a try.

860
00:43:58,500 --> 00:44:00,201
I should.

861
00:44:00,201 --> 00:44:02,704
[Kkang tries the wash treatment himself]

862
00:44:02,704 --> 00:44:04,005
You should give it a try.

863
00:44:04,005 --> 00:44:05,740
I should.

864
00:44:05,740 --> 00:44:07,909
[Designer Choi Kyung Ho]
Give it a try.

865
00:44:09,637 --> 00:44:12,246
You have to be thorough.

866
00:44:14,749 --> 00:44:16,251
As you work your way down from the top,

867
00:44:16,251 --> 00:44:18,453
make the seams and areas like this
a little darker,

868
00:44:18,453 --> 00:44:20,688
and as you move farther down...

869
00:44:20,688 --> 00:44:22,354
[Kkang starts the wash treatment himself]

870
00:44:24,859 --> 00:44:27,862
There are actually tons
of different wash techniques.

871
00:44:27,862 --> 00:44:31,666
But regular T-shirt washes are done in bulk,

872
00:44:31,666 --> 00:44:35,870
so it's hard to add much detail or design.

873
00:44:35,870 --> 00:44:39,641
I wanted to make something truly one of a kind

874
00:44:39,641 --> 00:44:41,643
and have it look like a piece of art.

875
00:44:41,643 --> 00:44:43,938
I think that's why I kept
thinking through every detail

876
00:44:43,938 --> 00:44:46,113
and trying things like this.

877
00:44:47,782 --> 00:44:51,003
[Hands at work on a one-of-a-kind piece]

878
00:44:51,003 --> 00:44:55,426
This piece is irreplaceable.
It's truly one of a kind,

879
00:44:55,426 --> 00:44:57,825
which made it even more satisfying.

880
00:44:59,427 --> 00:45:03,291
[Kkang Stylist's creations]

881
00:45:03,898 --> 00:45:09,137
Trying it myself made me realize
this really is art.

882
00:45:09,137 --> 00:45:13,241
I realized you can't judge it by price alone,

883
00:45:13,241 --> 00:45:14,609
and that made it even more appealing to me.

884
00:45:14,609 --> 00:45:18,546
I'd like to make more clothes
like this in the future.

885
00:45:18,546 --> 00:45:20,381
[New challenges expand fashion possibilities]

886
00:45:20,381 --> 00:45:23,751
This is just a cautious guess,

887
00:45:23,751 --> 00:45:28,356
but I think sales could reach
around 200 to 300 million won.

888
00:45:28,356 --> 00:45:31,385
[Sold out as soon as it launched]

889
00:45:32,838 --> 00:45:35,063
[Reviews pour in with restock requests]
We sacrificed both price and profit margin

890
00:45:35,063 --> 00:45:38,166
to drive sales as high as possible.

891
00:45:38,166 --> 00:45:40,335
I'm going to put Team Korea in first place.

892
00:45:40,335 --> 00:45:42,637
[Can he lead Team Korea to 1st place?]
I won't stop until I make it work.

893
00:45:45,406 --> 00:45:47,041
[Indonesia, Singapore & Malaysia,
Korea, Vietnam, China]

894
00:45:47,041 --> 00:45:48,721
[USA, Thailand, Japan]

895
00:45:51,269 --> 00:45:53,881
The international commerce competition,
X THE LEAGUE.

896
00:45:53,881 --> 00:45:55,283
We're your hosts, I'm Tiffany Young.

897
00:45:55,283 --> 00:45:56,317
And I'm BamBam.

898
00:45:56,317 --> 00:45:57,852
Great to have you with us.

899
00:45:57,852 --> 00:46:00,321
After 20 days of X THE LEAGUE,

900
00:46:00,321 --> 00:46:06,427
it's finally time to reveal the results of
Round 4, Unity Or Fall.

901
00:46:06,427 --> 00:46:08,338
[20 days together. Time to see the results]

902
00:46:10,698 --> 00:46:12,752
[A fiercely fought Round 4]

903
00:46:13,368 --> 00:46:16,938
[Team USA bets big on K-beauty]

904
00:46:16,938 --> 00:46:22,076
[Team Vietnam goes all in on local brands]

905
00:46:22,076 --> 00:46:25,830
[Thailand eyes a comeback with steady sales]

906
00:46:26,447 --> 00:46:29,117
[Indonesia holds firmly onto the lead]

907
00:46:29,117 --> 00:46:31,252
[Flawless execution, even on collab mission]

908
00:46:31,252 --> 00:46:35,163
[China crosses borders for mission points]

909
00:46:35,163 --> 00:46:36,958
[Noh Hee Young joins the all-out push]

910
00:46:36,958 --> 00:46:38,426
So many great options,
but here's why you need this.

911
00:46:38,426 --> 00:46:40,130
[Korea targets both missions and sales]

912
00:46:40,130 --> 00:46:44,065
[Team SG&MY targets mission points]

913
00:46:44,065 --> 00:46:47,938
[Japan battles to escape last place]

914
00:46:47,938 --> 00:46:49,771
No way. We're completely sold out.

915
00:46:49,771 --> 00:46:52,049
[Their first-ever sellout]

916
00:46:53,210 --> 00:46:56,003
[Round 4 Unity Or Fall ends]

917
00:46:56,003 --> 00:47:02,083
Round 4 Unity Or Fall was scored
out of 100 points.

918
00:47:02,083 --> 00:47:03,818
50 for total sales,

919
00:47:03,818 --> 00:47:05,953
40 for mission points,

920
00:47:05,953 --> 00:47:08,756
and 10 for fan votes.

921
00:47:08,756 --> 00:47:12,860
We'll reveal the total sales results first,

922
00:47:12,860 --> 00:47:16,864
which account for 50 points
of the Round 4 score.

923
00:47:16,864 --> 00:47:18,435
We're going to take first.

924
00:47:18,435 --> 00:47:21,268
What place do you think we'll get?

925
00:47:22,437 --> 00:47:24,804
I'll announce eighth place.

926
00:47:24,804 --> 00:47:25,840
Eighth place goes to...

927
00:47:25,840 --> 00:47:27,430
[Total sales rank No. 8 revealed first]

928
00:47:30,445 --> 00:47:32,413
Team Japan.

929
00:47:32,413 --> 00:47:34,682
Team Japan's total sales...

930
00:47:35,920 --> 00:47:39,587
were 40,414,007 won.

931
00:47:41,956 --> 00:47:45,159
Japan's sales are really low.

932
00:47:45,159 --> 00:47:47,495
[Still stuck near the bottom]

933
00:47:47,495 --> 00:47:50,431
I wish we'd been more proactive.

934
00:47:50,431 --> 00:47:53,968
[Where will Japan finish overall?]

935
00:47:53,968 --> 00:47:55,105
Seventh place goes to...

936
00:47:55,105 --> 00:47:58,474
[Which team ranks No. 7 in total sales?]

937
00:47:59,807 --> 00:48:01,109
Team Thailand.

938
00:48:01,109 --> 00:48:04,504
[Total sales No. 7: Team Thailand]

939
00:48:04,504 --> 00:48:09,850
77,025,127 won.

940
00:48:10,938 --> 00:48:14,255
That's actually not bad. Seriously.

941
00:48:15,123 --> 00:48:18,571
Seventh place is a good result for us too.
We'll keep taking on the challenge.

942
00:48:18,571 --> 00:48:23,330
[Super rich seller from Thailand]
This war isn't over yet.

943
00:48:24,065 --> 00:48:27,235
Next, I'll announce sixth place.

944
00:48:27,235 --> 00:48:29,170
Team USA.

945
00:48:29,170 --> 00:48:31,938
[Total sales No. 6: Team USA]
Where is everyone from Team USA?

946
00:48:31,938 --> 00:48:35,176
[Team USA absent due to scheduling]

947
00:48:35,176 --> 00:48:42,383
Team USA's total sales were 176,231,484 won.

948
00:48:42,383 --> 00:48:45,286
Next, I'll announce fifth place.

949
00:48:45,987 --> 00:48:49,838
[Which team is No. 5?]

950
00:48:49,838 --> 00:48:51,325
Fifth place is...

951
00:48:52,560 --> 00:48:54,429
Team China.

952
00:48:54,429 --> 00:48:56,600
Team China.

953
00:48:56,600 --> 00:48:59,974
[China falls from 2nd in Round 3
to 5th in Round 4]

954
00:49:00,838 --> 00:49:01,869
Team China?

955
00:49:01,869 --> 00:49:03,771
[China's unexpected sales drop]
Team China's total sales

956
00:49:03,771 --> 00:49:11,378
were 736,151,796 won.

957
00:49:12,246 --> 00:49:16,818
I was so shocked.
I never expected us to fall this far.

958
00:49:16,818 --> 00:49:18,953
[Round 1 total sales: about 2.8B won]

959
00:49:18,953 --> 00:49:21,556
[Round 2 total sales: about 1.7B won]

960
00:49:21,556 --> 00:49:23,991
[Round 3 total sales: about 1.5B won]

961
00:49:23,991 --> 00:49:26,871
[China's sales fall each round]

962
00:49:26,871 --> 00:49:28,532
[K-Wanghong of 2.8 billion won monthly sales]
It's devastating.

963
00:49:28,532 --> 00:49:31,136
[Where will Team China finish overall?]

964
00:49:31,802 --> 00:49:32,967
Fourth place goes to...

