Now, we'll reveal the Round 5 mission...

1214
01:02:25,339 --> 01:02:28,975
[What will the final mission be?]
that will decide your final fate.

1215
01:02:31,545 --> 01:02:32,779
[Overtake]

1216
01:02:32,779 --> 01:02:34,437
Overtake.

1217
01:02:34,437 --> 01:02:36,587
[Round 5 Overtake]

1218
01:02:36,587 --> 01:02:38,118
Overtake...

1219
01:02:38,919 --> 01:02:44,257
The points earned in Round 5 will count double.

1220
01:02:45,037 --> 01:02:47,828
That could completely turn things around.

1221
01:02:47,828 --> 01:02:50,404
If we nail the last round,
couldn't we take first?

1222
01:02:50,404 --> 01:02:52,399
[A last-round chance to turn it around]
We could turn everything around.

1223
01:02:52,399 --> 01:02:55,206
[1st generation influencer & actress]
I thought, "We can do this."

1224
01:02:55,206 --> 01:02:58,071
And the best part is the points count double.

1225
01:02:58,071 --> 01:02:59,873
We'll go all out in the final round.

1226
01:02:59,873 --> 01:03:03,776
[K-Wanghong of 2.8 billion won monthly sales]
This may be our only chance to beat Indonesia.

1227
01:03:03,776 --> 01:03:05,145
[Former Thai idol & actor turned CEO]
It made me want to fight back

1228
01:03:05,145 --> 01:03:08,404
and turn things around.

1229
01:03:08,404 --> 01:03:10,804
[Content creator with ten million fans]
We've had a little taste of X1,

1230
01:03:10,804 --> 01:03:13,687
and I really like being up there.

1231
01:03:13,687 --> 01:03:15,537
I don't want to lose that spot.

1232
01:03:15,537 --> 01:03:18,204
We'll do everything we can to hold onto it.

1233
01:03:18,204 --> 01:03:20,671
[Toward the top of the pyramid]
100 days of fierce selling.

1234
01:03:20,671 --> 01:03:23,437
[The final showdown begins]
We've finally reached the final moment.

1235
01:03:23,437 --> 01:03:27,301
Today is the day
we see the results of all our hard work.

1236
01:03:27,301 --> 01:03:28,669
I'm so proud of us.

1237
01:03:28,669 --> 01:03:31,471
It was the best competition show ever.

1238
01:03:31,471 --> 01:03:34,775
[BamBam's finale performance]

1239
01:03:34,775 --> 01:03:38,528
[Celebrate as fiercely as you've fought]

1240
01:03:39,150 --> 01:03:42,428
[The final results for the first champion]
Now only two teams remain.

1241
01:03:43,283 --> 01:03:45,385
I really want to win.

1242
01:03:45,385 --> 01:03:46,920
[Eight teams from nine countries fought hard]

1243
01:03:46,920 --> 01:03:47,788
Korea has to win.

1244
01:03:47,788 --> 01:03:49,723
Indonesia is definitely going to win.

1245
01:03:49,723 --> 01:03:51,091
The first-ever champion is...

1246
01:03:51,091 --> 01:03:51,758
[Desperate]

1247
01:03:51,758 --> 01:03:52,760
[Please]

1248
01:03:52,760 --> 01:03:53,794
[Nervous]

1249
01:03:53,794 --> 01:03:57,028
[Who will become the first champion?]
